{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time","id":1144000,"title":"Scion 2Ed Estimated release time","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-26T01:59:57-07:00","id":1144000,"title":"Scion 2Ed Estimated release time","content":"I was wondering when is the estimated release date of Scion 2Ed. I never played the first one but i'm looking forward try the second.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17573-andreabertocci","name":"Andreabertocci","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T02:55:44-07:00","id":1144008,"title":"","content":"They haven't given us a date but it was originally said to be coming out in May but it was delayed. There was a hint that an upcoming preview would include some elements of the base system as well. Hopefully soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8375-vonpenguin","name":"vonpenguin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T04:46:13-07:00","id":1144024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vonpenguin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1144008#post1144008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They haven't given us a date but it was originally said to be coming out in May but it was delayed. There was a hint that an upcoming preview would include some elements of the base system as well. Hopefully soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>This past May?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17573-andreabertocci","name":"Andreabertocci","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T07:11:18-07:00","id":1144050,"title":"","content":"Yes, but the system got overhauled with a major change (for the better we are assured) in the mechanics development for the base enginee shared with the Trinity Continuum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T20:03:54-07:00","id":1144613,"title":"","content":"The physical books were originally projected for next month. According to the Monday Meeting lists, Origins and Hero are currently (writing-wise) in development (but apparently past 2nd draft... I hope I'm reading that right), while Origins is in art direction.<br /> <br /> Right now, if we see Origins and Hero by March or April, I'd be willing to call it a win (although I'm sure hoping for sooner! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12628,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","user":"yukikaze","date":". 09-27-2017, 11:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-04T19:45:27-07:00","id":1146889,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d truly be surprised if we see the PDFs by June and I\u2019m beginning to wonder if scion will beat exalted record for how long it\u2019ll take. Oh well I still have Call of Cthulhu to play with and Numenera II which I\u2019m sure will deliver on time to run. As long as they don\u2019t have a Kickstarter for Demigod or God before we even get the Hero books I\u2019ll be okay","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6379-tytalan","name":"tytalan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-04T21:00:36-07:00","id":1146899,"title":"","content":"I mostly just wanna know when the BackerKit is gonna lock down. The credit card I have associated with it is gonna expire in February.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tytalan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1146889#post1146889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019d truly be surprised if we see the PDFs by June and I\u2019m beginning to wonder if scion will beat exalted record for how long it\u2019ll take. Oh well I still have Call of Cthulhu to play with and Numenera II which I\u2019m sure will deliver on time to run. As long as they don\u2019t have a Kickstarter for Demigod or God before we even get the Hero books I\u2019ll be okay</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ... You kidding? Scion's in Development right now, and Origins is in Art Direction. There's no <i>way </i>it could possibly take several years past this without everything going wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T05:39:09-07:00","id":1146983,"title":"","content":"When asked Richter if we have to wait a year from September, he said &quot;highly unlikely&quot;.<br /> <br /> If it could be done by march, I agree it would good enough.<br /> <br /> By the way, why the Shen Pantheon was previewed again?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T10:41:56-07:00","id":1147112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wickedgrail</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1146983#post1146983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the way, why the Shen Pantheon was previewed again?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was originally shared as a backer only preview on Kickstarter, it was recently shared for everyone else here on the Onyx Path site.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T10:54:50-07:00","id":1147120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheGraySoul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1147112#post1147112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It was originally shared as a backer only preview on Kickstarter, it was recently shared for everyone else here on the Onyx Path site.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So is the Orisha... okay... Thought something's changed... thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T14:06:33-07:00","id":1147192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wickedgrail</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1146983#post1146983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it could be done by march, I agree it would good enough.</div> </div> </div> </div>If Hero hasn't entered Art Direction, March feels really unlikely. 5+ months art direction, 3+ months layout feels like the absolute fastest Onyx Path can handle books of this scale. So if it entered art direction this month, May or June feel plausible. Personally I'm betting on September or October of next year, Rich's optimism notwithstanding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","user":"HighPriest","date":". 10-05-2017, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T20:53:39-07:00","id":1147308,"title":"","content":"I'll hold out hope for &quot;second quarter 2018.&quot;<br /> <br /> ...but I'm still gonna try kitbashing Godbound or Gods of the Fall, just in case...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12628,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","user":"yukikaze","date":". 10-06-2017, 12:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T21:27:51-07:00","id":1147317,"title":"","content":"Jetstream Scion and Origin have been both in development for serval months Origin has been in art also for about the same time I see no reason to expect the to be out in PDF before July at the earliest and probably not until October unless the have to rewrite everything again than who knows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6379-tytalan","name":"tytalan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T02:48:40-07:00","id":1147350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tytalan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1147317#post1147317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jetstream Scion and Origin have been both in development for serval months Origin has been in art also for about the same time I see no reason to expect the to be out in PDF before July at the earliest and probably not until October unless the have to rewrite everything again than who knows.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be extremely dissappointing... but what can we do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T08:19:46-07:00","id":1147430,"title":"","content":"The core system has been sent, guys <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T10:11:46-07:00","id":1147475,"title":"","content":"So it has been, and that's definitely not a bad thing! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I would think that, if they don't have the PDFs ready by year's end, that they should at least be in a position to give us a semi-firm projected release date...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T21:31:43-07:00","id":1147662,"title":"","content":"Yukikaze we just got told by Onyx Path that they do not give any estimates on release dats. In fact they basically told us on the Kickstarter comment section that it is company policy to keep us as much in the dark as they can get away with so as to not Disappoint Us By Being Off On A time Scale. So I expect we might hear about the PDFs a couple of days before we get them. But as someone pointed out the rules they sent us do not include the complete combat rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6379-tytalan","name":"tytalan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T22:16:03-07:00","id":1147668,"title":"","content":"It would still be nice if they did, especially if looked like the release would fall towards late summer/fall instead of earlier in the year. I can understand them wanting to not get burned on not living up to promised release dates, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12628,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","user":"yukikaze","date":".  To sound less fractious. 10-07-2017, 01:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T22:21:30-07:00","id":1147670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tytalan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1147662#post1147662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yukikaze we just got told by Onyx Path that they do not give any estimates on release dats. In fact they basically told us on the Kickstarter comment section that it is company policy to keep us as much in the dark as they can get away with so as to not Disappoint Us By Being Off On A time Scale.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s hard not to read this as malicious, intentional misrepresentation of what\u2019s been said. If they were trying to \u201ckeep us as much in the dark as possible\u201d, there wouldn\u2019t be updates to where books are in the production stages, and what\u2019s going on with them. I\u2019m sorry the fact that they don\u2019t want to give a date of release projection after previously being burned by unforeseen problems meeting said projections (common throughout the industry) bothers you, but that isn\u2019t justification to misrepresent what\u2019s been said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T05:11:21-07:00","id":1147731,"title":"","content":"Glamourweaver sorry you think what I said was misrepresentation of what was said to me but it really is not. I was told that we at scion were getting more information than any other Kickstarter backers from Onyx Path because they did not want to build up expectations of a release date. I\u2019ve already decided I\u2019ll get the books when I get them and I\u2019ll think twice about backing any of Onyx Paths project. That said I\u2019ll probably back The Trinity Kickstarters because I love the games but I\u2019ll know not to expect the kind of flow of information that I\u2019ll get from companies like Monte Cook Games, or Mongoose Publishing, or even Dream Pod 9 who ran a year and half over their time plan but kept us informed the whole time. It\u2019s kinda sad that OP takes this approach when Kickstarter suggests as much transparency as possible and supply\u2019s the tools for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6379-tytalan","name":"tytalan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T07:10:00-07:00","id":1147751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tytalan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1147731#post1147731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Glamourweaver sorry you think what I said was misrepresentation of what was said to me but it really is not. I was told that we at scion were getting more information than any other Kickstarter backers from Onyx Path because they did not want to build up expectations of a release date. I\u2019ve already decided I\u2019ll get the books when I get them and I\u2019ll think twice about backing any of Onyx Paths project. That said I\u2019ll probably back The Trinity Kickstarters because I love the games but I\u2019ll know not to expect the kind of flow of information that I\u2019ll get from companies like Monte Cook Games, or Mongoose Publishing, or even Dream Pod 9 who ran a year and half over their time plan but kept us informed the whole time. It\u2019s kinda sad that OP takes this approach when Kickstarter suggests as much transparency as possible and supply\u2019s the tools for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You have been informed where things stand with Neall's monthly updates and excerpts. You have a weekly progress report on my blog. Neall answers questions on the Scion forum thread right here, and you can ask him anything you want directly. These are the methods we have determined can best be used to inform our backers and they provide you with both an idea of where the projects are and that actual work is being done. Neall doesn't have unlimited free time, and I'd rather he spend what time he can carve from his full-time job on finishing the text. Every backer has a different amount of info that they need, and we do our best to supply the most info we can to satisfy the most number of backers we can, but obviously you need more than we are set up to give you. Should things change with how Neall develops Scion, then we'll be able to expand the amount and nature of the updates we provide, but for now we are giving you what we can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T03:09:20-08:00","id":1170889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1147751#post1147751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You have a weekly progress report on my blog.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I could ask, where might we find your blog?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7421-celtibear","name":"CeltiBear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T08:46:10