le":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T12:47:46-08:00","id":1171595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1171586#post1171586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We\u2019ve only got the Russian (Bogovi?) Mantle at this point, so it would be hard to pair him with an Alpine figure like that without a broader picture.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. I mean, the 'All Legends Are True' thing means the Krampus <i>exists</i>-","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T14:41:45-08:00","id":1171631,"title":"","content":"He'd work quite well as a scion of Mikola and a satyr, who takes after his father's more aggressive tendencies and combines them with the stricture not to forget children.<br /> Santa keeps him around because you can't turn your back on your kids, but has found the punishment of the Naughty with coal to be the only viable outlet for his son's proclivities to keep Krampus from turning half of Scandinavia's bedrooms into bloodbaths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13499-not-quite-yoda","name":"Not Quite Yoda","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T19:22:42-08:00","id":1171693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1171595#post1171595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True. I mean, the 'All Legends Are True' thing means the Krampus <i>exists</i>-</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh definitely, I\u2019m just saying our perspective on St Nicholas/Jolnar/etc is exclusively Russian, so we need to see other incarnations/mantles in other Pantheons.<br /> <br /> I mean, wouldn\u2019t Jolnar or Jolfadr be a Mantle of Odin?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-05T02:41:01-08:00","id":1173456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1146899#post1146899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mostly just wanna know when the BackerKit is gonna lock down. The credit card I have associated with it is gonna expire in February.<br /> <br /> ... You kidding? Scion's in Development right now, and Origins is in Art Direction. There's no <i>way </i>it could possibly take several years past this without everything going wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd <i>like</i> to agree with you, but I was there for the storm of awful that was the Ex3 Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2160-elemental","name":"Elemental","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"412"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-05T05:15:58-08:00","id":1173469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elemental</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-fo