ight--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If it was the first KS of theirs you'd come in on, anyway (and there's a fair chance it was); they'd already done five before then<i>.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>From what I understand, the Ex3 Kickstarter was kind of a perfect storm of &quot;Oops&quot;, between the many stretch goals changing the length of the books, system overhauls, Morke's health problems, playtester leaks...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-08T21:36:00-08:00","id":1174460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elemental</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1174121#post1174121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, but <i>Onyx Path</i> oversaw the game and KS, and it.....well, it wasn't the best first impression a company could have made.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m pretty sure the average of all their projects is a superior metric to their worst one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T01:35:34-08:00","id":1174804,"title":"","content":"Deleted Post","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","user":"HighPriest","date":". 01-10-2018, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T07:14:10-08:00","id":1174864,"title":"","content":"from the monday meeting seems that the art of origins is almost done<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T14:34:30-08:00","id":1174987,"title":"","content":"Yes but Hero hasn't even entered art direction yet. So since it is going to be a double release, going by the current pace it will be at least another 6 months till we see the books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T02:31:46-08:00","id":1175128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1174460#post1174460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019m pretty sure the average of all their projects is a superior metric to their worst one.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand, I'm not sure how fair it is to compare a new edition of a game with a new system to their standard stuff. In many ways, Exalted <i>is</i> the closest product to Scion. <br /> <br /> Still, I'm hopeful that we'll get the full text in the next month or two, finished PDFs ~a year late and hard copy... some time after that. <br /> <br /> I've got a fair bit riding on the full text arriving soon, as I'd like to run it after my current game which is starting to wrap up. I'm hopeful we'll have it by February (Really, I'm hopeful that we'll have it before the Aeon Kickstarter, but that might be overly optimistic). I've pitched it to the players and they seem keen, so just waiting on the actual game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2649-tarion","name":"Tarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T06:10:05-08:00","id":1175146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rickayelm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1174987#post1174987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes but Hero hasn't even entered art direction yet. So since it is going to be a double release, going by the current pace it will be at least another 6 months till we see the books.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, but per <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/scion-2nd-edition-tabletop-rpg/posts/2080604\" target=\"_blank\">the latest Kickstarter update</a>, once the editing and final development passes are done, they will be providing the full text to backers. Is it a completely finished book? No, but it is enough to play the game. And I for one really appreciate it too. Better to get it right the first time <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1897-ffanxii4ever","name":"ffanxii4ever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T12:31:43-08:00","id":1175257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1175146#post1175146\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, but per <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/scion-2nd-edition-tabletop-rpg/posts/2080604&amp;quot;]the</a> latest Kickstarter update[/URL], once the editing and final development passes are done, they will be providing the full text to backers. Is it a completely finished book? No, but it is enough to play the game. And I for one really appreciate it too. Better to get it right the first time <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Another nice thing about this, is that it will allow players and backers to give input on anything that may be confusing or unclear. A huge problem with EX3\u2019s release was that they kept it so close to the chest that when the final product was released, a huge chunk of the rules and charms were unclear in their execution and are still being clarified by the new developers, on the forums. Hopefully we can avoid that with a nice massive errata check here before Scion is finally released.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T13:38:37-08:00","id":1175266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1174460#post1174460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m pretty sure the average of all their projects is a superior metric to their worst one.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure the several projects I wasn't there for may have been better handled, but it wasn't a good <i>100% personal, 100% subjective impression</i>, when that was the one I started with. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Still, Scion is going better, since the creators seem to actually like talking to their backers and that makes the seemingly-inevitable delays much less onerous. I don't seriously think it'll be as bad as Ex3 based just on that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheGraySoul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1175257#post1175257\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another nice thing about this, is that it will allow players and backers to give input on anything that may be confusing or unclear. A huge problem with EX3\u2019s release was that they kept it so close to the chest that when the final product was released, a huge chunk of the rules and charms were unclear in their execution and are still being clarified by the new developers, on the forums. Hopefully we can avoid that with a nice massive errata check here before Scion is finally released.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's another good thing. One of the reasons Ex3 left a sour taste in my mouth was that the finished product didn't feel very polished, with a pile of errors being spotted within hours of release to a general audience. When you've got people who will proofread for free, it's just common sense to use them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2160-elemental","name":"Elemental","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"412"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T13:00:19-08:00","id":1175827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.earplay.com/stories/scion/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://earplay.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/ep-headersmall.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.earplay.com/stories/scion/\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.earplay.com/stories/scion/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.earplay.com/stories/scion/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> According to earplay the Scion story has a released date of 2018 TBD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T21:33:56-08:00","id":1175910,"title":"","content":"That fits with what they've been telling us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T14:01:05-08:00","id":1178184,"title":"","content":"I've always been an advocate of not rushing things for the sake of quality. What I've been reading so far has been pretty good stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T20:26:25-08:00","id":1178324,"title":"","content":"Oh huh, the Monday Meeting Notes have some notes. Apparently Scion Origins has been marked as being in &quot;Post-Editing Development&quot;, and Heroes is noted as &quot;With Neall for some tweaks&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T21:46:59-08:00","id":1178343,"title":"","content":"Scion has been with neall for for three weeks now, hopefully into editing soon. I'm crossing my fingers we get origins now instead of having to wait for hero to also be done since that's likely gonna be another month or so, but it's not really my decision either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-23T08:57:34-08:00","id":1178449,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">In the meeting note comments, Yodo asked &quot;<span style=\"color:#555555\">Just so I can get my reading list sorted out \u2013 now Scion: Origin is done with its editing pass, will the text file go out straight away? Or will y\u2019all wait until Hero\u2019s done as well? All good either way, I\u2019m just too eager for it to let the question go unanswered!&quot; and RichT responded &quot;You'll find out pretty soon...&quot;, which makes me THINK we might be getting Origins in the next couple days, given the coy tone.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23646-goblinsociety","name":"GoblinSociety","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-23T11:10:02-08:00","id":1178490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GoblinSociety</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1178449#post1178449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">In the meeting note comments, Yodo asked &quot;<span style=\"color:#555555\">Just so I can get my reading list sorted out \u2013 now Scion: Origin is done with its editing pass, will the text file go out straight away? Or will y\u2019all wait until Hero\u2019s done as well? All good either way, I\u2019m just too eager for it to let the question go unanswered!&quot; and RichT responded &quot;You'll find out pretty soon...&quot;, which makes me THINK we might be getting Origins in the next couple days, given the coy tone.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I would love that. Plus, getting the full text of Storypath out before the Trinity Kickstarter does make some sense...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1897-ffanxii4ever","name":"ffanxii4ever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-23T14:34:59-08:00","id":1178556,"title":"","content":"Aw man, now I'm gonna be checking the kickstarter every other hour just to make sure I finally catch it when it comes out. Still, with this and the trinity kickstarter in such a short time, at the very least the storypath stuff is all finally coming to a head. Makes me reminisce about back in the day when it was still called codename sardonyx.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T11:34:03-07:00","id":1256179,"title":"","content":"What the current status for complete books to non backers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T16:34:48-07:00","id":1256267,"title":"","content":"Boy looking at all these missed estimates really makes you pessimistic about the release date.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12349-evilnerf","name":"evilnerf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12349_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T16:40:48-07:00","id":1256271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1146899#post1146899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mostly just wanna know when the BackerKit is gonna lock down. The credit card I have associated with it is gonna expire in February.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> ... You kidding? Scion's in Development right now, and Origins is in Art Direction. There's no <i>way </i>it could possibly take several years past this without everything going wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooof this was posted just under 2 years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12349-evilnerf","name":"evilnerf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12349_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T18:53:03-07:00","id":1256318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evilnerf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1256271#post1256271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ooof this was posted just under 2 years ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>And we know exactly why it\u2019s late. It\u2019ll be fine.<br /> <br /> Also it was October 2017. That was last year. It hasn\u2019t even been ONE","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-24T21:28:07-07:00","id":1257082,"title":"","content":"I would like to note, for the record, that Scion Origin and Hero are both in Proofing right now.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/a-whiff-of-pumpkin-guts-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/a-whiff-of-pumpkin-guts-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> A Whiff of Pumpkin Guts [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/a-whiff-of-pumpkin-guts-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/a-whiff-of-pumpkin-guts-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <ul><li><b>Scion Hero </b><b>\u2013 </b>Need Neal\u2019s 2nd proof changes.</li> <li><b>Scion Origin </b><b>\u2013 </b>Doing Neall\u2019s errata changes, and swapping out the font.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div><br /> So, y'know. We're kinda in the home stretch","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T00:36:49-07:00","id":1257109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1144000-scion-2ed-estimated-release-time?p=1256179#post1256179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What the current status for complete books to non backers?</div> </div> </div> </div>A semi-finished Origin was sent out to backers over four months ago, and is still having backer errata integrated. Since a similar Hero copy hasn't been sent to backers yet for an errata check, almost certainly at least four more months.<br /> <br /> Of course, that's assuming you mean purchasable PDFs for &quot;complete books&quot;. Physical copies will take a lot longer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}